        "blocks": [
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-001",
            "text": "# 学生组织活动与社会实践审核 测试材料规则来源",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 0
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-002",
            "text": "**范围声明：**本文件用于隔离的合成流程测试，不是正式校规、申报通知、财务审批或法律意见。所有测试身份、编号和金额均虚构。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 1
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-003",
            "text": "## 公开来源与适用边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 2
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-004",
            "text": "### 成都理工大学2026年第十三届“学创杯”校赛通知",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 3
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-005",
            "text": "- 来源：https://aao.cdut.edu.cn/info/1442/7002.htm",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 4
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-006",
            "text": "- 适用范围：仅该项竞赛及校赛选拔，不提供综测或一般竞赛成果的本校积分映射。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 5
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-007",
            "text": "## 本次审核的规则边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 6
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-008",
            "text": "没有找到适用于所有学生组织活动的本校通用公开审批标准。活动安全、场地、保险与经费制度须负责人补充。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 7
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-009",
            "text": "## 测试要求",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 8
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-010",
            "text": "- 只把来源文件中明确写出的内容当作外部规则。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 9
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-011",
            "text": "- 缺少校内当年通知、审批、积分映射、授权签字或有效性确认时，标记待确认，不要猜测。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 10
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-012",
            "text": "- 证据需要引用案卷中的具体材料与可定位位置。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 11
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyk6ps0-v1-block-013",
            "text": "- 本文件并非本次模拟数据的答案。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 12
            },
            "kind": "text"
          }
        ],
        "usage": "registered",
        "byteHash": "70e34160c776fa8080503a125e9f72d65dc50ba1f9171a09f3b49f5dec9a2c0c",
        "active": true
      },
